{"seq":1,"slug":"rectifier-pfc-topologies","title":"整流器拓扑与功率因数校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers/rectifier-pfc-topologies","wordCount":1645,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"整流器拓扑与功率因数校正\">整流器拓扑与功率因数校正</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>整流器的核心矛盾是：<strong>二极管桥只在电压峰值附近导通，天然把正弦输入电流变成尖峰脉冲</strong>，功率因数因此只有 0.5-0.7，并向电网注入大量低次谐波。PFC 的全部工作就是用有源开关能力，主动把输入电流塑造成与电压同相的正弦波，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PF \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>功率因数可分解为位移因数与畸变因数之积，所以提升它的手段既要控制相位（同相），也要控制波形（正弦）。围绕这一目标衍生出 Boost PFC、无桥/图腾柱 PFC、三相 Vienna 等拓扑：它们的分野在于如何处理传统二极管桥带来的损耗，以及在什么功率等级下换取效率与成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整流器基本原理\">整流器基本原理</h2><p>整流器将交流电（AC）转换为直流电（DC），是几乎所有离线式电源的前级。从最简单的二极管桥式整流到有源 PFC 拓扑，整流器的核心目标是高效地从电网提取能量，同时满足电网谐波和功率因数的法规要求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[整流器分类] --&gt; B[不控整流 二极管桥]&#10;    A --&gt; C[半控整流 晶闸管]&#10;    A --&gt; D[全控整流 有源PFC]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[简单,PF≈0.5-0.7]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[调压,工业电机]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[PF&gt;0.99,低谐波]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[单相/三相 Boost PFC]\">graph TD\n    A[整流器分类] --&gt; B[不控整流 二极管桥]\n    A --&gt; C[半控整流 晶闸管]\n    A --&gt; D[全控整流 有源PFC]\n    B --&gt; B1[简单,PF≈0.5-0.7]\n    C --&gt; C1[调压,工业电机]\n    D --&gt; D1[PF&gt;0.99,低谐波]\n    D --&gt; D2[单相/三相 Boost PFC]</pre><p>不带 PFC 的传统二极管整流器仅在电压峰值附近导通，输入电流呈尖峰脉冲形式，功率因数仅约 0.5-0.7，并向电网注入大量低次谐波（3、5、7 次等）。IEC 61000-3-2 标准对超过 75W 的设备强制要求功率因数校正。</p>\n<p>功率因数定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>位移因数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>畸变因数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PF = \\frac{P}{S} = \\frac{P}{V_{rms} \\cdot I_{rms}} = \\cos\\phi \\cdot \\frac{I_1}{I_{rms}} = \\text{位移因数} \\times \\text{畸变因数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位移因数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">畸变因数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基波电流有效值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 为基波电流与电压的相位差。理想 PFC 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PF \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，即输入电流为与电压同相的正弦波。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有源-pfc-拓扑\">有源 PFC 拓扑</h2><h3 id=\"boost-pfc\">Boost PFC</h3><p>Boost PFC 是最广泛使用的单相有源功率因数校正拓扑。其原理是通过控制 Boost 变换器的瞬时电感电流跟踪输入电压波形，使输入电流呈正弦形状：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_L^*(t) = \\frac{2P_o}{V_{in,rms}^2} \\cdot v_{in}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4593em;vertical-align:-1.099em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.099em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PFC 模式</th>\n<th>工作特点</th>\n<th>THD</th>\n<th>效率</th>\n<th>功率范围</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CCM</td>\n<td>电流连续，定频,EMI 可控</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>96-99%</td>\n<td>200W-10kW</td>\n<td>服务器/工业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrM/BCM</td>\n<td>临界模式，变频,ZVS 可实现</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n<td>95-98%</td>\n<td>75-500W</td>\n<td>LED/小型电源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCM</td>\n<td>电流断续，简化控制,PF 自然高</td>\n<td>&lt; 15%</td>\n<td>93-95%</td>\n<td>75-200W</td>\n<td>低成本适配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交错 CrM</td>\n<td>两相交错，纹波消除</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>96-98%</td>\n<td>200W-3kW</td>\n<td>充电器/OBC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CCM Boost PFC 的控制结构包含电压外环和电流内环：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{cv}(s) \\to i_L^* = G_{cv}(s) \\cdot v_{in}(t) \\cdot (V_{ref} - V_o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9857em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>电压环带宽必须远低于工频二次纹波频率（100/120Hz），通常设计为 10-20Hz，以避免输出纹波反馈到电流参考引起输入电流畸变。</p>\n<h3 id=\"图腾柱无桥-pfc\">图腾柱无桥 PFC</h3><p>传统 Boost PFC 的输入二极管桥在大电流下产生可观损耗（约占总损耗的 30-40%）。图腾柱（Totem-pole）无桥 PFC 用两组半桥直接实现整流和 Boost 功能，消除了二极管桥损耗：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[图腾柱PFC优势] --&gt; B[消除桥式整流损耗]&#10;    A --&gt; C[效率提升1-2%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[功率密度更高]&#10;    E[GaN使能] --&gt; F[CCM图腾柱成为可能]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[GaN零反向恢复]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[SiC体管恢复极小]&#10;    G[效率水平] --&gt; G1[GaN图腾柱:99%+]&#10;    G --&gt; G2[SiC图腾柱:98.5%+]\">graph LR\n    A[图腾柱PFC优势] --&gt; B[消除桥式整流损耗]\n    A --&gt; C[效率提升1-2%]\n    A --&gt; D[功率密度更高]\n    E[GaN使能] --&gt; F[CCM图腾柱成为可能]\n    F --&gt; F1[GaN零反向恢复]\n    F --&gt; F2[SiC体管恢复极小]\n    G[效率水平] --&gt; G1[GaN图腾柱:99%+]\n    G --&gt; G2[SiC图腾柱:98.5%+]</pre><p>传统硅 MOSFET 因体二极管的反向恢复问题无法在 CCM 图腾柱中使用。SiC MOSFET 的体二极管几乎无反向恢复（单极性器件），GaN HEMT 完全没有反向恢复电荷，使得 CCM 图腾柱 PFC 在 2020 年后迅速成为高效服务器电源的标配前级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PFC 拓扑</th>\n<th>器件类型</th>\n<th>额定效率</th>\n<th>功率密度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统 Boost PFC</td>\n<td>Si MOSFET</td>\n<td>96-97%</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无桥 PFC (CrM)</td>\n<td>Si MOSFET</td>\n<td>97-98%</td>\n<td>1.2×</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图腾柱 PFC (CCM)</td>\n<td>GaN HEMT</td>\n<td>99-99.3%</td>\n<td>1.5×</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图腾柱 PFC (CCM)</td>\n<td>SiC MOS</td>\n<td>98.5-99%</td>\n<td>1.4×</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三相整流器\">三相整流器</h2><p>三相系统在中大功率应用中（&gt; 3kW）比单相具有更低的纹波和更高的功率密度。三相有源整流器（也称 Vienna 整流器或三相 Boost PFC）实现三相输入的单位功率因数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>三相整流拓扑</th>\n<th>开关管数</th>\n<th>电压应力</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>6 脉冲二极管桥</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>线电压峰值</td>\n<td>简单,PF≈0.95</td>\n<td>低要求工业负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vienna 整流器</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Vdc/2</td>\n<td>低器件应力，三电平</td>\n<td>EV 充电桩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两电平 VSR</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Vdc</td>\n<td>双向功率流</td>\n<td>储能/电机再生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三电平 NPC VSR</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>Vdc/2</td>\n<td>低谐波，高效率</td>\n<td>大功率变流器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Vienna 整流器是三相 PFC 应用中最具性价比的拓扑——仅需 3 个有源开关（比全桥少一半），每个开关仅承受一半直流母线电压，天然形成三电平波形，THD 极低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pfc-设计中的工程挑战\">PFC 设计中的工程挑战</h2><p>实际 PFC 设计中需解决的关键工程问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>浪涌电流限制</strong>：上电瞬间输出电容等效为短路，需 NTC 限流或有源预充电</li>\n<li><strong>保持时间设计</strong>：电网掉电后维持输出的时间（通常 20ms），决定了输出电容大小</li>\n<li><strong>交叉失真</strong>：输入电压过零点附近的电流畸变，CCM 模式通过前馈补偿解决</li>\n<li><strong>EMI 滤波</strong>：PFC 级高频纹波需要差模和共模滤波器衰减</li>\n<li><strong>输出电压选择</strong>：通常选择 380-400V（通用输入）或 800V（三相/高压架构）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>o</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{out} = \\frac{2 \\cdot P_o \\cdot t_{hold}}{V_o^2 - V_{o,min}^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4593em;vertical-align:-1.099em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.099em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2026 年 AI 数据中心推动 800V DC 架构普及，三相 PFC 直接整流至 800V 母线，消除了传统 400V→800V 的中间升压级，系统效率从 95% 提升至 97% 以上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>不带 PFC 的二极管整流器输入电流呈尖峰脉冲，PF 仅 0.5-0.7；IEC 61000-3-2 对 75W 以上设备强制要求 PFC。</li>\n<li>功率因数 = 位移因数 × 畸变因数，理想 PFC 使输入电流为与电压同相的正弦波。</li>\n<li>Boost PFC 是最广泛使用的单相有源方案，CCM（大功率、低 THD）、CrM、交错 CrM 各有其功率与成本区间；电压环带宽须远低于 100/120Hz 二次纹波。</li>\n<li>图腾柱无桥 PFC 消除二极管桥损耗，效率提升 1-2%，但只有 SiC/GaN 的无反向恢复特性才使其能在 CCM 下工作，可达 99%+。</li>\n<li>三相整流（Vienna/两电平 VSR/三电平 NPC）适合 &gt; 3kW 场合，Vienna 以 3 个开关实现三电平，是中大功率性价比之选。</li>\n<li>PFC 工程的现实约束包括浪涌电流限制、保持时间（决定输出电容）、交叉失真与 EMI 滤波，输出电压通常取 380-400V，AI 数据中心则趋向 800V 母线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"整流器拓扑与功率因数校正","id":"整流器拓扑与功率因数校正"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"整流器基本原理","id":"整流器基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"有源 PFC 拓扑","id":"有源-pfc-拓扑"},{"level":3,"text":"Boost PFC","id":"boost-pfc"},{"level":3,"text":"图腾柱无桥 PFC","id":"图腾柱无桥-pfc"},{"level":2,"text":"三相整流器","id":"三相整流器"},{"level":2,"text":"PFC 设计中的工程挑战","id":"pfc-设计中的工程挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高效率设计技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/dc-dc-converters/high-efficiency-techniques"},"next":{"title":"逆变器拓扑分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers/inverter-topologies"}}